.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-runner-delete \- Delete a runner.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab runner delete  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Permanently deletes a runner from the GitLab instance.

.PP
Prerequisites:
.IP \(bu 2
Maintainer or Owner role for project runners.
.IP \(bu 2
Owner role for group runners.
.IP \(bu 2
Administrator access for instance runners.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-f\fP, \fB--force\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompt.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Delete a runner (prompts for confirmation)
glab runner delete 6

# Skip confirmation prompt
glab runner delete 6 --force
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-runner(1)\fP
